  "title": "GitHub App installation token fixtures (authored)",
  "description": "Authored base samples for the opaque and the stateless JWT forms of the GitHub App installation token, near-miss and public-data controls, and carrier-context projections of the bases. Bases carry no lineage; every derived fixture names its base in lineage.",
