  "lifecycle": "draft",
  "notes": "Project-authored; every credential-shaped value is synthetic and was never issued or tested against any service. Stateless tokens: ghs_ + a 7-digit placeholder app id (0000001, 0000002; absent in one base) + _ + a JWT whose header is the standard HS256 header, whose payload is JSON with the note 'synthetic never issued credential-evidence fixture' and a filler field, and whose third segment is the marker SYNTHETICneverissued plus 23 characters of the base64url SHA-256 of 'credential-evidence:synthetic-never-issued:<label>', which is no signature any GitHub issuer produced. Opaque tokens: ghs_ + the 36 characters SYNTHETICneverissued followed by sixteen zeros. The third JWT segment starts with the marker SYNTHETICneverissued. Context projections (json, authorization, git-url, korean-emoji, crlf, env) were produced by a one-off deterministic template script kept out of the repository, then reviewed and committed as authored fixtures; they are not a generation-rule set. Not-assertable fixtures carry no expectation; the candidateReading on the app-id-less base proposes nothing a consumer may score. Verification must remain disabled."
}
